  "description": "Hypertension Clinical Ontology is an OWL ontology designed to represent clinical knowledge related to hypertension. It includes concepts such as blood pressure classifications, hypertension types, symptoms, risk factors, biomarkers, complications, and treatment-related relationships. The ontology supports semantic organization, reasoning, and DL query-based exploration of hypertension-related biomedical knowledge.",
